WEBVTT

01:30.230 --> 01:34.900
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.150 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 35]

02:43.800 --> 02:44.530
You're done?

02:45.710 --> 02:46.280
Done.

02:47.520 --> 02:48.360
Wait a moment.

02:58.280 --> 02:58.840
Try it.

03:01.460 --> 03:02.660
Be careful, it's hot.

03:16.560 --> 03:17.120
How is it?

03:20.400 --> 03:21.310
So delicious.

03:22.560 --> 03:23.030
When I return, I must

03:23.030 --> 03:24.190
spread this recipe

03:24.470 --> 03:26.730
so humans everywhere can enjoy noodles.

03:28.600 --> 03:31.480
So, noodles were invented by
Hong Ye and me?

03:37.060 --> 03:38.120
You should eat too.

03:38.840 --> 03:39.240
Okay!

04:15.470 --> 04:16.610
Everyone, come quickly!

04:16.610 --> 04:18.000
There are pearls everywhere!

04:18.000 --> 04:19.120
Where? Where?

04:19.240 --> 04:20.190
Where are the pearls?

04:20.190 --> 04:21.310
Hurry up and come over!

04:21.310 --> 04:21.870
Coming! Coming!

04:21.870 --> 04:22.880
I'm coming!

04:22.920 --> 04:24.060
Come quickly!

04:24.750 --> 04:26.480
Thank you for the ingredients.

04:26.560 --> 04:27.500
These pearls

04:27.560 --> 04:29.760
are my gift of gratitude to the village.

04:33.750 --> 04:34.480
Dragon Lord,

04:34.830 --> 04:36.560
we have searched everywhere at sea,

04:36.560 --> 04:37.870
but there are only scattered islands

04:37.870 --> 04:39.560
with nothing special about them.

04:39.560 --> 04:41.950
I haven't seen any springs
on any of the islands.

04:41.950 --> 04:44.950
I really don't know
where this celestial mountain is.

04:49.000 --> 04:50.159
Since it's a celestial mountain,

04:50.159 --> 04:51.600
it won't be easy to find.

04:52.630 --> 04:54.120
I'll ask other clans later

04:54.120 --> 04:55.720
if they have any other clues.

04:56.470 --> 04:56.950
Okay.

04:58.159 --> 04:58.920
Dragon Lord.

05:01.420 --> 05:02.510
The Qiong Qi leader is outside.

05:02.510 --> 05:04.120
He says he has something for you.

05:04.120 --> 05:05.050
Qiong Qi is here?

05:05.310 --> 05:05.750
Yes.

05:06.310 --> 05:06.840
Perfect.

05:06.870 --> 05:08.510
I'll ask Qiong Qi if he has any ideas.

05:08.510 --> 05:09.440
Wait for me here.

05:22.360 --> 05:22.920
Qiong Qi!

05:25.580 --> 05:26.360
Xiao Yao.

05:27.430 --> 05:28.070
I'm sorry.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.270
I was delayed for a few days

05:30.270 --> 05:31.730
and missed your birthday.

05:31.750 --> 05:32.310
But...

05:32.920 --> 05:34.240
You'll definitely like

05:34.240 --> 05:35.300
the gift this time.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.600
What weapon is it this time?

05:39.830 --> 05:40.880
It's not a weapon.

05:49.040 --> 05:49.990
Little ones,

05:50.450 --> 05:51.360
you existed in this world

05:51.360 --> 05:53.070
ten thousand years ago?

05:56.580 --> 05:58.040
I've searched high and low for so long.

05:58.040 --> 06:00.370
I can't believe it's still
something you're familiar with.

06:00.370 --> 06:01.460
Familiar they may be,

06:01.460 --> 06:03.590
but I haven't seen them for a long time.

06:04.390 --> 06:05.170
Thank you.

06:05.230 --> 06:06.560
I really like this gift.

06:08.190 --> 06:09.710
Glad you like it.

06:10.200 --> 06:10.680
At...

06:11.160 --> 06:12.390
At least my efforts

06:12.720 --> 06:14.010
weren't in vain.

06:14.510 --> 06:14.920
Come.

06:16.630 --> 06:17.510
Don't be afraid.

06:17.510 --> 06:19.040
I will protect you well.

06:27.430 --> 06:28.510
Cultivation is not easy.

06:28.510 --> 06:29.930
You must hide well.

06:30.270 --> 06:31.990
If other tribes find you,

06:42.060 --> 06:43.370
you won't be so lucky.

06:46.390 --> 06:47.720
Where did you find them?

06:48.040 --> 06:48.900
Mount Zhaoyao.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.170
Take them back.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.880
I thought you liked them.

06:58.120 --> 07:00.390
Wouldn't it be nice to have them
keep you company in the Dragon Palace?

07:00.390 --> 07:01.630
They prefer cold and dark places,

07:01.630 --> 07:02.830
and thrive in groves.

07:03.040 --> 07:04.070
Living underwater

07:04.070 --> 07:06.000
isn't good for their cultivation.

07:08.360 --> 07:09.960
Thank you for your kindness.

07:10.120 --> 07:11.170
I'll go with you

07:11.430 --> 07:12.830
to find them a safe place.

07:13.750 --> 07:14.360
Excellent.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.020
Excellent.

07:15.510 --> 07:17.040
These creatures are too small.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.790
I'm too rough,

07:19.070 --> 07:20.470
so I need you to come with.

07:23.510 --> 07:25.370
How did you get injured like this?

07:25.750 --> 07:27.040
On a deserted island,

07:27.680 --> 07:29.160
I startled a pair of love birds.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.120
They chased and attacked me,

07:30.120 --> 07:31.380
and this is the result.

07:31.430 --> 07:31.960
However,

07:32.310 --> 07:34.370
they're not much better off than I am.

07:36.190 --> 07:38.270
Quickly, go ask the Dragon Lord
for ambergris.

07:38.270 --> 07:38.930
-Yes.
-Yes.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.750
The Dragon Lord asked you
to find the celestial mountain,

07:48.750 --> 07:50.310
not to create one yourself.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.940
Why push yourself so hard?

07:52.120 --> 07:53.110
I must obey

07:53.260 --> 07:54.560
the Dragon Lord's orders.

07:54.560 --> 07:55.390
Since I've heard them,

07:55.390 --> 07:56.790
I must fulfill them well.

07:58.190 --> 07:59.120
Yes, yes.

08:01.510 --> 08:02.040
Long Zhi,

08:02.190 --> 08:03.310
be gentle.

08:03.360 --> 08:05.510
That's what you get
for overestimating yourself.

08:05.510 --> 08:06.630
Let me try.

08:11.160 --> 08:12.560
The Dragon Lord sent you?

08:13.500 --> 08:15.560
I heard you were looking for ambergris.

08:15.560 --> 08:17.040
I guessed you were injured,

08:17.040 --> 08:18.040
so I brought some.

08:24.810 --> 08:27.270
Since you were injured while searching for
the celestial mountain,

08:27.270 --> 08:28.120
allow me

08:28.290 --> 08:30.020
to offer my humble assistance.

08:44.200 --> 08:47.060
Your technique in applying medicine
is quite good.

08:48.330 --> 08:51.130
Perhaps because I've been injured
too many times.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.920
You dared to attack the Dragon Lord twice.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.550
Only hurting you is light punishment.

08:55.550 --> 08:56.080
Besides,

08:56.840 --> 08:57.870
our search for the celestial mountain

08:57.870 --> 08:59.930
is also by the Dragon Lord's command.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.670
It has nothing to do with you.

09:01.670 --> 09:02.470
I understand.

09:05.320 --> 09:07.090
I was foolish before.

09:07.600 --> 09:09.120
After spending time with the Dragon Lord,

09:09.120 --> 09:11.840
I finally realized
the Dragon Lord's intentions toward me.

09:11.840 --> 09:12.330
So,

09:12.720 --> 09:14.720
you've only heard of the Yuli Spring

09:14.910 --> 09:16.440
on the celestial mountain.

09:16.550 --> 09:18.150
You've never seen it, right?

09:18.550 --> 09:19.680
That is a divine gift

09:19.790 --> 09:21.050
bestowed upon humans.

09:22.240 --> 09:24.270
Humans who drink it
can achieve immortality.

09:24.270 --> 09:25.320
If demons drink it,

09:25.320 --> 09:27.450
their power can greatly increase too.

09:29.720 --> 09:31.030
It can enhance power?

09:31.070 --> 09:31.630
Yes.

09:31.790 --> 09:33.050
How much must one drink

09:33.200 --> 09:35.460
and how much can it increase one's power?

09:35.750 --> 09:36.910
That I don't know.

09:38.510 --> 09:39.910
If it were truly effective,

09:39.910 --> 09:41.600
then all demons would stop cultivation

09:41.600 --> 09:43.150
and just drink this spring water
to become great demons.

09:43.150 --> 09:46.010
They wouldn't need to
undergo tribulation either.

09:46.790 --> 09:47.990
What is tribulation?

09:49.080 --> 09:50.210
Tribulation is when

09:50.600 --> 09:52.510
after reaching
a certain level of cultivation,

09:52.510 --> 09:54.970
demons must face trials
arranged by heaven.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.210
It's a test

09:56.320 --> 09:57.550
and also a punishment.

09:57.550 --> 09:58.080
Only by

09:58.720 --> 09:59.790
surviving the heavenly tribulation

09:59.790 --> 10:02.650
can one enter
the next higher level of cultivation.

10:03.030 --> 10:04.670
If one fails the tribulation,

10:04.670 --> 10:06.730
at best, their power will be damaged;

10:07.360 --> 10:07.960
at worst,

10:08.150 --> 10:09.380
their soul will be destroyed.

10:09.380 --> 10:10.440
Is it that serious?

10:10.550 --> 10:11.360
Yes.

10:12.340 --> 10:13.250
Enough.

10:13.840 --> 10:15.120
If you're so afraid of tribulation,

10:15.120 --> 10:16.550
then just stop cultivating.

10:16.550 --> 10:19.080
Always talking about
tribulation like this,

10:19.120 --> 10:20.780
you'll speak it into reality.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.670
Why is she so angry?

10:33.360 --> 10:34.390
I almost forgot.

10:34.870 --> 10:35.790
Long Zhi

10:35.840 --> 10:37.900
is approaching her tribulation day.

10:42.270 --> 10:43.270
For many things,

10:43.840 --> 10:44.840
you can't avoid them

10:44.840 --> 10:46.370
just because you fear them,

10:46.670 --> 10:49.270
nor can you escape from them
simply out of fear.

10:49.270 --> 10:50.400
When you're afraid,

10:50.440 --> 10:52.200
think about how you must do it,

10:52.630 --> 10:53.790
how you have no choice,

10:53.790 --> 10:56.190
and perhaps
you won't be so afraid anymore.

10:56.510 --> 10:57.240
I'm leaving.

10:59.630 --> 11:01.440
Tell me more

11:01.440 --> 11:02.700
about the Yuli Spring.

11:03.030 --> 11:03.850
What else

11:03.960 --> 11:04.840
did heaven

11:04.840 --> 11:05.840
tell you humans?

11:09.270 --> 11:10.000
Dragon Lord.

11:16.150 --> 11:16.870
You human,

11:16.870 --> 11:19.400
how dare you not kneel
before the Dragon Lord?

11:21.050 --> 11:22.180
Why should he kneel?

11:27.440 --> 11:28.990
I'm going out with Qiong Qi.

11:29.960 --> 11:31.020
Wait for my return.

11:34.360 --> 11:35.350
While I'm gone,

11:35.440 --> 11:36.640
don't cause trouble.

11:37.200 --> 11:38.150
Rest assured, Dragon Lord.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.060
I'm here.

11:39.600 --> 11:40.870
We're about to face tribulation.

11:40.870 --> 11:43.270
How can we care
about such trivial matters?

11:46.900 --> 11:48.000
Rest assured, Dragon Lord.

11:48.000 --> 11:48.930
After you leave,

11:49.030 --> 11:50.550
we will protect Hong Ye.

11:56.750 --> 11:57.270
Here.

11:58.480 --> 11:59.670
Keep it safe for me.

12:00.200 --> 12:00.800
Remember,

12:01.320 --> 12:02.510
don't let it leave your side.

12:02.510 --> 12:03.440
Mermaid pearls?

12:03.960 --> 12:05.690
Even one mermaid pearl is rare,

12:05.840 --> 12:07.900
yet you gave a whole string to Hong Ye.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.000
Because I want to.

12:10.390 --> 12:11.000
I...

12:18.360 --> 12:19.150
Alright,

12:20.030 --> 12:21.430
it's about time to leave.

12:21.750 --> 12:22.410
Wait for me.

12:22.600 --> 12:23.600
I'll be back soon.

12:23.780 --> 12:24.350
Okay.

12:28.750 --> 12:29.280
Let's go.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.800
That's all I know.

12:41.320 --> 12:43.270
If you have any news about the Yuli Spring
on the celestial mountain,

12:43.270 --> 12:44.400
you must let me know.

12:45.550 --> 12:46.750
If what you say is true

12:47.320 --> 12:48.380
and the Yuli Spring

12:48.380 --> 12:49.910
can make humans immortal

12:50.240 --> 12:51.770
and enhance demons' power,

12:52.000 --> 12:53.360
wouldn't that break the rules
of gradual progression

12:53.360 --> 12:54.510
for cultivation?

12:56.150 --> 12:57.750
I'm afraid this might not be good

12:57.750 --> 12:58.950
for humans or demons.

13:17.550 --> 13:19.340
I thought I had caught a lot.

13:19.960 --> 13:22.620
I didn't expect there was
more to discover here.

13:26.500 --> 13:26.910
Okay.

13:50.150 --> 13:51.390
Qiong Qi and I

13:51.440 --> 13:53.100
will help you build a barrier,

13:53.120 --> 13:55.110
so you won't be disturbed
by the outside world anymore

13:55.110 --> 13:57.150
and can multiply and thrive on your own.

13:57.150 --> 13:58.240
Are you willing?

14:09.000 --> 14:10.440
During your celestial worship,

14:10.440 --> 14:11.390
didn't you ask

14:11.390 --> 14:13.850
which direction the celestial mountain is?

14:14.790 --> 14:16.900
The deity must test our sincerity

14:17.030 --> 14:19.030
before revealing any divine signs.

14:20.150 --> 14:21.480
There are so few clues.

14:21.680 --> 14:22.550
Indeed.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.130
For many years,

14:24.240 --> 14:26.080
humans have performed
celestial worship every month,

14:26.080 --> 14:27.080
but only that one time

14:27.080 --> 14:28.840
did we receive guidance from the deity.

14:28.840 --> 14:29.770
What is a month?

14:30.080 --> 14:30.910
Humans

14:31.030 --> 14:31.790
mark the beginning of each day

14:31.790 --> 14:33.120
by sunrise and moonset.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.030
Thirty days make a month.

14:35.030 --> 14:35.830
Twelve months

14:36.030 --> 14:36.750
make a year.

14:37.200 --> 14:39.460
So that's how humans calculate time?

14:39.510 --> 14:39.910
Yes.

14:41.870 --> 14:42.670
There's more.

14:42.870 --> 14:44.550
A day is divided into
12 shichen.

14:44.550 --> 14:45.510
Within that, there are

14:45.510 --> 14:47.770
hours, quarters, minutes, and seconds.

14:48.670 --> 14:51.250
Humans are truly meticulous about time.

14:51.630 --> 14:52.670
We demons

14:52.670 --> 14:53.360
only have

14:53.600 --> 14:56.000
days, years, eras, and millennia.

14:56.150 --> 14:57.790
The differences
between humans and demons

14:57.790 --> 14:58.720
are everywhere.

14:59.600 --> 15:00.600
It doesn't matter.

15:00.600 --> 15:02.720
Once we find the Yuli Spring
on the celestial mountain,

15:02.720 --> 15:03.550
won't you humans

15:03.550 --> 15:05.330
be able to measure time like us?

15:08.870 --> 15:10.600
Do you truly want to help humans

15:10.630 --> 15:11.890
achieve immortality?

15:12.320 --> 15:13.650
What's wrong with that?

15:18.030 --> 15:18.600
Nothing.

15:20.670 --> 15:21.800
The Dragon Lord said

15:21.960 --> 15:24.150
humans are also part of all living beings.

15:24.150 --> 15:27.360
I don't understand what it feels like
to protect all beings,

15:27.360 --> 15:28.440
but whatever the Dragon Lord says

15:28.440 --> 15:29.240
must be right.

15:29.670 --> 15:31.330
Humans are truly too fragile.

15:31.720 --> 15:33.600
If you could also achieve immortality,

15:33.600 --> 15:35.200
the Dragon Lord would surely be happy.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.550
When the Dragon Lord is happy,

15:36.550 --> 15:37.440
I am happy too.

15:40.200 --> 15:40.550
Come.

15:41.030 --> 15:42.090
To immortality.

15:43.150 --> 15:44.080
To immortality.

15:51.200 --> 15:52.960
The Dragon Lord
has shown me great kindness.

15:52.960 --> 15:55.000
If I could truly obtain the Yuli Spring,

15:55.000 --> 15:56.860
I would have a chance to repay her.

16:00.720 --> 16:02.360
Now that I've fully recovered,

16:02.360 --> 16:03.630
I want to return immediately

16:03.630 --> 16:04.790
to lead humans in celestial worship

16:04.790 --> 16:06.270
and seek guidance from the deity.

16:06.270 --> 16:06.960
Perhaps

16:07.240 --> 16:08.750
we could gain more information
about the celestial mountain

16:08.750 --> 16:09.960
and the Yuli Spring.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.790
The Dragon Lord hasn't returned yet.

16:12.790 --> 16:14.000
You cannot leave.

16:14.870 --> 16:16.470
Could you accompany me then?

16:17.790 --> 16:18.270
But...

16:18.480 --> 16:20.000
If the Dragon Lord blames me later,

16:20.000 --> 16:21.330
you must explain for me.

16:22.870 --> 16:23.470
Of course.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.530
Can the Dragon Lord fly too?

16:29.670 --> 16:30.300
Of course.

16:30.670 --> 16:32.240
She flies the highest and fastest.

16:32.240 --> 16:32.870
When she gets tired of flying,

16:32.870 --> 16:34.730
she can ride the mystical turtle.

16:36.270 --> 16:37.930
Then why did she just row a boat

16:38.410 --> 16:39.870
when we went to sea before?

16:41.670 --> 16:42.800
The Dragon Lord

16:43.000 --> 16:44.460
must have her own reasons.

17:10.829 --> 17:11.660
This way,

17:12.119 --> 17:14.119
whether humans or demons come here,

17:14.440 --> 17:16.040
they will take another path.

17:18.170 --> 17:20.109
This will be our secret.

17:20.310 --> 17:22.710
Not a single word
can be revealed to others.

17:24.109 --> 17:24.750
All right.

17:24.790 --> 17:25.790
From now on,

17:25.920 --> 17:27.450
pretend you never saw them.

17:28.510 --> 17:28.920
Okay.

17:31.960 --> 17:33.090
You don't like that?

17:34.160 --> 17:35.170
Of course not.

17:38.840 --> 17:39.460
If...

17:40.000 --> 17:40.880
I mean, if by chance

17:40.880 --> 17:42.310
you really see the deity again,

17:42.310 --> 17:43.440
remember to help me ask

17:43.440 --> 17:45.520
if Yuli Spring can enhance power,

17:45.750 --> 17:47.350
can it also help avoid tribulation?

17:47.350 --> 17:47.790
Sure.

17:48.400 --> 17:48.790
Okay.

17:50.830 --> 17:51.750
Shouldn't you have

17:51.750 --> 17:53.680
experienced tribulation before?

17:53.830 --> 17:55.050
Why are you so afraid?

17:55.310 --> 17:56.240
It's different.

17:56.310 --> 17:57.200
The higher your power,

17:57.200 --> 17:58.510
the greater the tribulation.

17:58.510 --> 18:00.830
Last time was already extremely dangerous.

18:00.830 --> 18:02.110
Fortunately, I prayed
before the Dragon Essence Pearl

18:02.110 --> 18:03.400
for three whole years.

18:03.550 --> 18:05.410
That's why I returned unscathed.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.720
Dragon Essence Pearl?

18:06.720 --> 18:07.590
The Dragon Essence Pearl

18:07.590 --> 18:10.440
is formed from the essence
from prior dragon generations.

18:10.440 --> 18:11.920
Every dragon prays before
the Dragon Essence Pearl

18:11.920 --> 18:13.530
before facing tribulation.

18:13.640 --> 18:15.300
If they return successfully,

18:15.310 --> 18:17.680
they add their a sliver
of their essence to the Pearl,

18:17.680 --> 18:19.200
blessing those who come after.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.330
And so it continues,

18:20.350 --> 18:22.370
making our dragon clan stronger.

18:22.590 --> 18:23.510
That sounds

18:24.240 --> 18:26.440
similar to the deity statues of humans.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.790
It's the dragon clan's greatest treasure,

18:28.790 --> 18:30.640
containing thousands of dragon essences.

18:30.640 --> 18:32.340
It has the power to create a new world.

18:32.340 --> 18:33.610
If someone obtained it,

18:33.610 --> 18:35.480
wouldn't their power
increase tremendously?

18:35.480 --> 18:36.570
Since it's so precious,

18:36.570 --> 18:38.970
it's guarded by the most powerful dragons.

18:39.180 --> 18:39.740
Besides,

18:39.960 --> 18:41.510
the Dragon Lord now has
the power of the Azure Dragon.

18:41.510 --> 18:42.550
Who could possibly take it?

18:42.550 --> 18:44.030
It's not just the Dragon Essence Pearl.

18:44.030 --> 18:46.030
The vine serpent clan's Mist Pearl,

18:46.070 --> 18:47.590
the Qiong Qi Clan's
Primordial Pearl,

18:47.590 --> 18:49.720
and other ancestral pearls of major clans

18:49.720 --> 18:51.310
all contain immense power.

18:51.680 --> 18:53.240
The primordial spirit and beastly nature
within the pearls

18:53.240 --> 18:54.500
can affect one's mind.

18:54.720 --> 18:55.450
Eventually,

18:55.550 --> 18:57.270
you wouldn't be using the pearl.

18:57.270 --> 18:59.330
The pearl would be using you instead.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.240
I'm still young.

19:08.620 --> 19:09.760
It's not my time yet!

19:10.170 --> 19:12.180
Could I be facing tribulation early?

19:12.180 --> 19:13.670
I'm not ready!

19:16.640 --> 19:17.360
Hong Ye!

19:23.680 --> 19:24.140
What...

19:24.790 --> 19:25.640
Why are the waves so big?

19:25.640 --> 19:26.700
What's happening?

19:26.880 --> 19:27.870
What's going on?

19:28.200 --> 19:29.260
What's happening?

19:35.670 --> 19:37.730
Who stirred up these waves on the sea?

19:38.960 --> 19:39.790
I don't know.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.520
Where is Long Yu?

19:44.160 --> 19:45.030
The young dragon is playful.

19:45.030 --> 19:46.500
He's probably still playing with Hong Ye.

19:46.500 --> 19:47.830
Come take a look with me.

19:48.480 --> 19:49.210
Dragon Lord!

19:49.460 --> 19:51.320
Dragon Lord, please save Hong Ye!

19:51.880 --> 19:52.960
What happened to Hong Ye?

19:52.960 --> 19:55.040
I was flying with him
over the sea,

19:55.270 --> 19:57.270
but suddenly,
the sky and sea changed color.

19:57.270 --> 19:59.410
A huge wave
crashed into us amid the lightning.

19:59.410 --> 20:00.750
When I made it through the wave,

20:00.750 --> 20:01.940
Hong Ye was gone.

20:02.110 --> 20:03.550
I searched in the sea for a long time

20:03.550 --> 20:05.310
but couldn't find him anywhere.

20:05.310 --> 20:05.590
Do...

20:05.590 --> 20:07.890
Do humans also experience tribulation?

20:09.110 --> 20:11.110
What just happened
was clearly not a tribulation.

20:11.110 --> 20:13.240
It must've been a great demon
casting spells at sea.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.590
Great demons with such power

20:14.590 --> 20:16.450
are extremely rare in this world.

20:56.920 --> 20:57.440
Dragon Lord.

20:57.440 --> 20:58.240
Any findings?

21:02.240 --> 21:04.640
Continuing to search like this won't work.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.590
Perhaps you

21:05.590 --> 21:06.680
could borrow

21:06.680 --> 21:08.110
the Mist Pearl from the vine serpent clan?

21:08.110 --> 21:09.030
The Mist Pearl?

21:09.270 --> 21:10.640
It's the vine serpents' treasure

21:10.640 --> 21:14.170
that can show the current state
of any demon you're thinking of.

21:15.580 --> 21:16.720
It works for humans too,

21:16.720 --> 21:18.250
as long as he's still alive.

21:20.080 --> 21:22.040
But Teng She is carefree

21:22.100 --> 21:23.550
and always hard to locate.

21:23.550 --> 21:26.010
Where would we find him
on such short notice?

21:44.240 --> 21:45.600
Who are you?

21:46.830 --> 21:48.630
You're not worthy to ask my name.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.160
Humans are inferior.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.720
I heard you're a human prince.

21:54.310 --> 21:56.600
That makes you the lowest of the low.

21:57.880 --> 21:59.140
You should understand

21:59.240 --> 22:00.970
that if your life is worthless,

22:01.030 --> 22:03.160
yet you obtain what you don't deserve,

22:03.480 --> 22:05.070
death isn't far away.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.070
That is...

22:08.350 --> 22:10.210
That belongs to the Azure Dragon.

22:18.790 --> 22:20.880
You think using the Azure Dragon's name

22:20.880 --> 22:22.350
will save your life?

22:22.840 --> 22:24.680
I gave it to Xiao Yao once,

22:25.800 --> 22:27.530
so I can give it to her again.

22:28.400 --> 22:29.440
As for you?

22:29.830 --> 22:31.290
The Azure Dragon is noble.

22:31.440 --> 22:32.960
When you stay by her side

22:34.110 --> 22:36.120
and touch her possessions,

22:36.350 --> 22:37.830
you're defiling her.

22:39.160 --> 22:40.550
You deserve to die.

22:43.240 --> 22:44.030
Turns out...

22:45.640 --> 22:47.500
It turns out a great demon like you

22:47.880 --> 22:49.070
also gets afraid.

22:50.030 --> 22:50.680
What?

23:06.550 --> 23:07.520
You fear me.

23:19.270 --> 23:20.070
Come on,

23:20.950 --> 23:22.030
tell me.

23:24.240 --> 23:25.920
What's there to be afraid of?

23:27.160 --> 23:28.690
You're afraid that Xiao Yao

23:29.550 --> 23:31.020
truly likes

23:32.000 --> 23:33.350
a human like me.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.880
You're a mere human.

23:37.350 --> 23:39.160
Within less than a century,

23:40.160 --> 23:42.430
she won't even remember your name.

23:44.200 --> 23:45.590
But no matter when,

23:46.510 --> 23:47.910
she will always remember

23:48.960 --> 23:50.510
that you killed me.

23:54.110 --> 23:55.590
If you kill me,

23:57.160 --> 23:59.550
she will hate you forever.

24:03.480 --> 24:04.970
You worthless human!

24:05.640 --> 24:08.100
You only spent a few days
with the Dragon Lord

24:08.310 --> 24:09.550
and you're already using her name

24:09.550 --> 24:10.550
to threaten me.

24:20.720 --> 24:22.550
What a despicable human.

24:23.270 --> 24:25.400
Instead of thinking of how to survive,

24:25.550 --> 24:27.810
you dare to covet what you don't deserve.

24:28.160 --> 24:28.790
Very well.

24:30.110 --> 24:30.920
Today,

24:32.240 --> 24:34.720
I'll let your own kind teach you

24:36.070 --> 24:37.830
how to be a proper human.

24:41.070 --> 24:41.870
Bring them in!

24:42.510 --> 24:43.240
Hurry up!

24:48.720 --> 24:49.490
Prince Ye!

24:50.240 --> 24:51.310
It's Prince Ye!

24:51.310 --> 24:52.920
Prince Ye, save us!

24:52.920 --> 24:53.590
Prince Ye,

24:53.590 --> 24:54.440
save us!

24:54.510 --> 24:56.410
Prince Ye, help us!

24:57.350 --> 24:58.750
Please save us!

24:59.310 --> 25:01.110
How have my people offended you?

25:04.830 --> 25:06.680
The obsidian from Mount Qingyuan

25:06.680 --> 25:08.030
means nothing

25:08.030 --> 25:08.880
to us demons.

25:09.130 --> 25:10.520
But when humans use it,

25:10.960 --> 25:12.360
it generates yang energy

25:12.440 --> 25:13.640
and opens meridians,

25:14.270 --> 25:16.720
so humans always take risks to extract it.

25:18.680 --> 25:20.130
You are their prince.

25:21.510 --> 25:23.240
If you want to save their lives,

25:26.790 --> 25:27.720
crawl over there

25:28.930 --> 25:31.590
and bring the obsidian to my feet
with your mouth.

25:31.590 --> 25:32.990
For each piece you bring,

25:33.640 --> 25:35.200
I'll spare one life.

25:41.830 --> 25:42.630
What's wrong?

25:43.750 --> 25:44.790
You don't want to?

25:51.440 --> 25:53.370
You're not speaking.

25:56.680 --> 25:58.140
Prince Ye, please save us!

25:58.160 --> 25:59.510
Prince Ye, please save us!

25:59.510 --> 26:00.840
I don't want to die!

26:02.590 --> 26:04.720
I don't like the look in your eyes.

26:06.310 --> 26:06.790
Stop!

26:11.570 --> 26:12.600
I'll kneel.

26:37.680 --> 26:38.820
Yao!

26:39.160 --> 26:39.920
You came just in time.

26:39.920 --> 26:41.380
I was about to look for you.

26:48.400 --> 26:51.130
How did you know
I wanted to borrow the Mist Pearl?

26:51.350 --> 26:52.750
You've been spying on me.

26:54.720 --> 26:56.750
This is the greatest treasure of my clan.

26:56.750 --> 26:58.400
I can't just use it casually.

26:58.830 --> 27:00.200
I just happened to see

27:00.200 --> 27:02.720
that you wanted to borrow it from me,

27:03.110 --> 27:05.920
so I brought it to you...

27:06.640 --> 27:07.830
Fine.

27:08.590 --> 27:09.750
I recently heard that

27:09.750 --> 27:11.950
you've been especially nice
to a human.

27:12.110 --> 27:14.240
I wanted to see what that was all about.

27:15.680 --> 27:16.590
Finding him is priority.

27:16.590 --> 27:18.030
Finding him is priority.

27:23.400 --> 27:25.160
Carefully recall his appearance,

27:25.160 --> 27:26.720
then project it into the Mist Pearl

27:26.720 --> 27:28.320
and you'll be able to see him.

27:30.510 --> 27:32.040
The stronger your longing,

27:32.400 --> 27:33.930
the clearer you'll see him.

27:43.830 --> 27:45.020
He has...

27:45.640 --> 27:46.900
obsidian in his mouth?

27:49.810 --> 27:51.910
Mount Qingyuan is rich in obsidian.

27:53.920 --> 27:56.150
That's where the Ao Hen Clan dwells.

27:57.480 --> 27:58.900
Him?

28:01.030 --> 28:02.640
I'll go with you!

28:07.550 --> 28:08.330
Yao,

28:09.240 --> 28:10.750
it's just a mere human.

28:11.070 --> 28:13.530
Why should you trouble yourself
to save him?

28:16.990 --> 28:18.540
Rumors are being spread.

28:19.160 --> 28:20.240
And they don't sound good.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.030
They're saying

28:21.030 --> 28:22.350
that the way you're treating

28:22.350 --> 28:22.880
a human

28:23.510 --> 28:24.640
is quite unusual.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.270
I said it's impossible.

28:26.270 --> 28:27.230
Those humans

28:27.350 --> 28:28.160
are both despicable

28:28.160 --> 28:29.160
and incompetent.

28:29.350 --> 28:31.410
But what you're doing will certainly

28:31.960 --> 28:33.640
cause some controversy.

28:35.000 --> 28:35.480
You...

28:35.480 --> 28:36.880
Why are you glaring at me?

28:38.000 --> 28:39.440
We've known each other
for a thousand years,

28:39.440 --> 28:41.900
yet I've never seen you
care so much about me.

28:41.920 --> 28:43.650
Then suddenly a human appears,

28:43.750 --> 28:45.720
and you're incredibly concerned about him.

28:45.720 --> 28:48.110
Hong Ye is the one I once told you about
who captured my heart,

28:48.110 --> 28:50.030
the husband I chose for myself.

28:51.110 --> 28:52.590
Human or demon,

28:52.750 --> 28:54.350
I don't care what others say.

28:54.550 --> 28:56.480
But if anyone dares to harm Hong Ye,

28:56.480 --> 28:57.610
I will show no mercy.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.160
How long have you known each other?

28:59.160 --> 29:00.590
How much do you really know about him?

29:00.590 --> 29:01.920
Don't lose your senses.

29:01.960 --> 29:02.550
Teng She.

29:03.480 --> 29:05.280
I've said what needed to be said.

29:06.680 --> 29:08.790
Thank you for lending me the Mist Pearl.

29:08.790 --> 29:10.160
I'll save my man myself.

29:10.270 --> 29:12.270
You don't need to follow me anymore.

29:37.750 --> 29:38.550
Wait.

29:41.590 --> 29:43.310
Who told you to stand up?

29:48.660 --> 29:50.120
Quite humane indeed.

29:50.550 --> 29:51.070
Come on!

29:52.270 --> 29:53.650
Beg your prince

29:54.000 --> 29:55.120
to save you!

29:55.200 --> 29:55.790
Speak!

29:55.790 --> 29:56.400
Don't!

29:57.260 --> 29:57.870
Prince!

29:58.110 --> 29:59.160
Prince, save us!

29:59.160 --> 30:00.010
No need.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.030
Prince, save us!

30:05.070 --> 30:05.940
Too slow!

30:20.960 --> 30:21.480
Wake up.

30:23.590 --> 30:24.110
Wake up.

30:24.510 --> 30:25.110
Wake up.

30:43.640 --> 30:46.160
You've gone too far.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.070
I'll use their lives

30:55.720 --> 30:57.960
to teach you how to be a proper human.

30:58.680 --> 31:00.940
You're nothing but a servant to dragons.

31:01.820 --> 31:03.620
Know your place.

31:04.110 --> 31:05.750
You can't even save your own life.

31:05.750 --> 31:07.610
You don't deserve anything more,

31:08.400 --> 31:10.730
much less to be
by the Azure Dragon's side.

31:10.830 --> 31:11.960
If you want to live,

31:12.920 --> 31:15.040
disappear from Xiao Yao's sight.

31:15.810 --> 31:16.720
Understand?

31:18.240 --> 31:19.360
Either endure,

31:19.440 --> 31:20.790
or be ruthless.

31:21.200 --> 31:22.800
Only then can you stand firm.

31:23.460 --> 31:24.870
For you humans,

31:26.400 --> 31:27.640
you can only endure.

31:29.640 --> 31:30.590
Originally,

31:32.070 --> 31:34.200
I also felt unworthy of her.

31:35.350 --> 31:37.930
I didn't dare imagine
any relationship with the Azure Dragon.

31:37.930 --> 31:38.750
I even

31:39.640 --> 31:42.350
tried to escape my momentary feelings

31:42.370 --> 31:44.160
and decided to stay away from Xiao Yao,

31:44.160 --> 31:46.190
which gave you the chance

31:47.030 --> 31:48.400
to kidnap me,

31:49.290 --> 31:51.410
humiliate me,

31:53.160 --> 31:55.180
and kill my citizens.

31:57.310 --> 31:58.070
You say

31:58.510 --> 32:01.010
I don't deserve to stand beside Xiao Yao.

32:01.630 --> 32:03.910
My suffering today

32:05.360 --> 32:07.550
is precisely because you're jealous

32:08.030 --> 32:09.880
that I now stand by

32:10.350 --> 32:11.930
the Azure Dragon's side.

32:12.070 --> 32:13.710
She has saved me twice.

32:15.300 --> 32:16.500
For my sake,

32:17.440 --> 32:19.240
she fought against her own kind.

32:19.680 --> 32:22.470
She went to find the Yuli
from the celestial mountain for me.

32:22.470 --> 32:24.280
She even told me...

32:27.750 --> 32:30.640
I'm her destined husband.

32:31.070 --> 32:32.200
But you...

32:32.830 --> 32:35.270
You went to great lengths to please her,

32:37.460 --> 32:39.110
giving her mermaid pearls.

32:40.150 --> 32:41.690
But to her,

32:41.970 --> 32:44.940
you can be discarded like worn-out shoes.

32:47.210 --> 32:48.680
How laughable.

32:51.740 --> 32:53.540
You're just a lowly human.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.390
Shut your mouth!

33:07.400 --> 33:10.790
Though I am a "lowly human" as you say,

33:13.640 --> 33:15.590
I act with integrity.

33:15.750 --> 33:17.550
I'm not treacherous and vicious

33:18.200 --> 33:19.880
like you.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.960
Although I have no power,

33:27.000 --> 33:29.420
and cannot protect my people,

33:30.120 --> 33:33.090
I am willing to die alongside them.

33:34.000 --> 33:35.960
I will not beg for your mercy,

33:38.070 --> 33:40.260
nor will I, for the sake of survival,

33:43.550 --> 33:45.700
agree to stay away from Xiao Yao.

33:47.100 --> 33:48.070
Because

33:49.030 --> 33:51.070
even if I die,

33:52.330 --> 33:54.870
Xiao Yao will remember me forever.

33:58.160 --> 34:00.090
If you want to kill me,

34:04.820 --> 34:05.990
do it.

34:09.710 --> 34:11.320
You're seeking death

34:12.320 --> 34:13.840
to disrupt my mind.

34:15.590 --> 34:16.670
Delusional.

34:19.000 --> 34:21.280
You think too highly of yourself.

34:21.320 --> 34:23.110
Even if Xiao Yao is the Dragon Lord,

34:23.110 --> 34:24.909
she cannot control everything.

34:25.290 --> 34:27.750
Since she has the duty
to protect all beings,

34:28.030 --> 34:29.860
she would never become enemies

34:30.710 --> 34:32.679
with the Ao Hen Clan for you.

34:33.630 --> 34:34.830
There's also Qiong Qi

34:35.159 --> 34:36.110
and Teng She.

34:36.840 --> 34:38.840
Do you think they would approve of

34:39.139 --> 34:41.100
the Azure Dragon being with you?

34:41.630 --> 34:43.850
And would Xiao Yao, for your sake,

34:44.030 --> 34:45.760
turn against both of them?

34:46.860 --> 34:48.699
I admit you're somewhat clever.

34:49.929 --> 34:51.730
But since you're seeking death,

34:52.840 --> 34:54.050
I'll do as you say.

34:54.800 --> 34:55.440
Ao Hen!

34:55.960 --> 34:56.710
Come out!

35:00.590 --> 35:01.190
Ao Hen,

35:01.710 --> 35:02.560
come out!

35:03.510 --> 35:04.760
I know you can hear me.

35:05.110 --> 35:06.440
If you dare harm Hong Ye,

35:06.760 --> 35:08.090
I'll make you regret it.

35:08.960 --> 35:09.760
Xiao Yao.

35:13.320 --> 35:14.360
Your life

35:15.230 --> 35:16.760
will be spared a bit longer.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.070
Guard him.

35:35.510 --> 35:36.440
Where's Hong Ye?

35:39.810 --> 35:41.940
I risked my life to find this treasure.

35:42.460 --> 35:44.390
Why did you give it to a lowly human?

35:44.890 --> 35:45.830
In your eyes,

35:46.480 --> 35:47.960
am I not as good as a human?

35:50.700 --> 35:52.110
What did you do to Hong Ye?

35:56.240 --> 35:57.640
He won't die that easily.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.360
You truly disappoint me.

36:01.470 --> 36:03.860
I fell in love with you at first sight,

36:04.150 --> 36:06.350
yet I never dared to reveal my feelings.

36:07.280 --> 36:09.140
Because you are the Azure Dragon.

36:09.150 --> 36:10.320
You're meant to be exalted

36:10.320 --> 36:11.850
and revered by all spirits.

36:12.590 --> 36:14.250
I feared I wasn't good enough,

36:14.960 --> 36:17.090
afraid my feelings would disturb you.

36:17.230 --> 36:19.200
I even took every word you said

36:19.320 --> 36:20.720
as my guiding principle.

36:21.110 --> 36:22.970
I devoted myself to cultivation,

36:23.360 --> 36:25.690
no longer committing any wrongful deeds.

36:26.400 --> 36:27.590
But I never imagined

36:29.150 --> 36:31.150
you would treat yourself like this,

36:31.880 --> 36:33.000
being intimate

36:34.070 --> 36:35.480
with a human.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.230
Tell me where Hong Ye is.

36:41.110 --> 36:42.570
Hand Hong Ye over to me now!

36:43.230 --> 36:44.360
What if I refuse?

36:55.470 --> 36:57.320
Punish me as you wish.

37:16.550 --> 37:19.230
The Ao Hen Clan occupies Mount Qingyuan

37:19.760 --> 37:21.000
because of

37:21.840 --> 37:22.920
the obsidian.

37:24.990 --> 37:27.790
Then the place
with the strongest obsidian energy

37:28.110 --> 37:30.510
must be where
the cave dwelling is located.

37:54.920 --> 37:56.360
A great demon
has broken through the barrier!

37:56.360 --> 37:57.760
Hurry and inform Master!

38:11.360 --> 38:12.030
You are

38:12.760 --> 38:13.670
Hong Ye?

38:15.960 --> 38:17.110
Yes, I am.

38:19.280 --> 38:21.070
Answering so readily.

38:21.710 --> 38:23.510
You think I'm here to rescue you?

38:25.150 --> 38:26.920
You've also come to kill me.

38:29.960 --> 38:32.090
Is it because of Xiao Yao?

38:32.320 --> 38:33.720
How dare you mention her?

38:34.840 --> 38:35.880
For your sake,

38:36.030 --> 38:37.670
Xiao Yao ignores all the criticism
from demons.

38:37.670 --> 38:38.300
For you,

38:38.440 --> 38:40.480
she's now fighting fiercely with Ao Hen.

38:40.480 --> 38:41.150
For you,

38:41.150 --> 38:42.350
she's even willing to

38:43.070 --> 38:44.230
sever ties with me.

38:46.000 --> 38:47.750
I too received a divine revelation.

38:47.750 --> 38:48.840
Would you like to know

38:48.840 --> 38:49.920
what I saw?

38:51.190 --> 38:54.090
I saw what my future husband looks like.

38:55.070 --> 38:55.590
You

38:55.740 --> 38:57.610
are my destined husband.

39:07.990 --> 39:09.900
What's so special about you

39:10.550 --> 39:12.440
that she can't live without you?

39:13.680 --> 39:15.110
I only know

39:17.540 --> 39:19.420
she is someone

39:21.520 --> 39:23.590
I'll protect for my entire life.

39:28.440 --> 39:29.190
Fine.

39:32.110 --> 39:32.670
This

39:33.110 --> 39:34.440
is the Samadhi Yin Fire.

39:38.580 --> 39:39.580
Don't be afraid.

39:39.840 --> 39:41.170
It won't kill you.

39:41.710 --> 39:43.300
It will only make you suffer

39:43.840 --> 39:46.100
the agony of your body and heart burning.

39:47.030 --> 39:48.180
As long as you live,

39:48.550 --> 39:50.210
I'll make you suffer each day.

39:55.800 --> 39:57.530
Can't bear it anymore, can you?

39:57.920 --> 39:58.820
I knew

39:59.070 --> 40:00.360
a human like you

40:00.440 --> 40:02.190
could never make her happy.

40:03.760 --> 40:05.070
But if you promise me

40:05.590 --> 40:07.690
to never see Xiao Yao again,

40:08.150 --> 40:09.010
I'll let you go.

40:13.400 --> 40:14.440
Speak.

40:19.960 --> 40:21.020
Just say it,

40:21.150 --> 40:23.210
and you won't have to suffer anymore.

40:23.710 --> 40:24.560
Say it.

40:26.440 --> 40:27.730
Say it!

40:29.150 --> 40:30.070
Speak!

40:34.360 --> 40:35.490
Why won't you say it?

40:35.840 --> 40:37.230
Promise me you'll never see her again,

40:37.230 --> 40:38.440
and I'll free you from this pain.

40:38.440 --> 40:39.430
Just say it.

40:39.800 --> 40:40.730
Say it!

40:44.590 --> 40:46.650
If I can see her again,

40:49.000 --> 40:50.320
this little suffering

40:51.230 --> 40:53.150
means nothing at all.
